  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:300px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-gold pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Absorbent Creation</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/3/35/Paper_Mario_Car_Sponge_Sticker.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20190803221122\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Paper Mario Car Sponge Sticker\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/3/35/Paper_Mario_Car_Sponge_Sticker.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20190803221122\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/3/35/Paper_Mario_Car_Sponge_Sticker.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20190803221122 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/3/35/Paper_Mario_Car_Sponge_Sticker.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20190803221122 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Paper Mario Car Sponge Sticker\" width=\"270\" height=\"372\" data-image-key=\"Paper_Mario_Car_Sponge_Sticker.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Paper Mario Car Sponge Sticker.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Paper Mario (Paper Mario: Sticker Star) can create a large sponge with the 'Car Sponge Thing Sticker.'</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Create absorbents.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to&#160;<b>create absorbents.</b>&#160;Sub-power of&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Sponge_Manipulation\" title=\"Sponge Manipulation\">Sponge Manipulation</a>. Variation of&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Object_Creation\" title=\"Object Creation\">Object Creation</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorbent_Creation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Absorbent Generation/Manifestation</li>\n<li>Sponge Generation/Creation/Manifestation</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorbent_Creation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>User can generate any absorbents of any kind, including: kitchen sponges, car sponges, or even natural sponges.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorbent_Creation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Object_Creation\" title=\"Object Creation\">Object Creation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Object_Manipulation\" title=\"Object Manipulation\">Object Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Plastic_Generation\" title=\"Plastic Generation\">Plastic Generation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Plastic_Manipulation\" title=\"Plastic Manipulation\">Plastic Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Plastic_Mimicry\" title=\"Plastic Mimicry\">Plastic Mimicry</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Water_Absorption\" title=\"Water Absorption\">Water Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Water_Generation\" title=\"Water Generation\">Water Generation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Water_Manipulation\" title=\"Water Manipulation\">Water Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Water_Mimicry\" title=\"Water Mimicry\">Water Mimicry</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorbent_Creation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May only be able to create certain types of absorbents.</li>\n<li>May create a certain amount at a time.</li>\n<li>Cannot control created absorbents.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorbent_Creation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Paper Mario (<i>Paper Mario: Sticker Star</i>) via the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.mariowiki.com/Sponge_(Thing)\">Sponge Sticker</a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.mariowiki.com/Car_Sponge\">Car Sponge Sticker</a></li>\n<li>Katiya (<i>Supermonsters</i>) via her magic wand.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260802034839\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.015 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.019 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 98/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 89/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 142/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.081      1 Template:Infobox\n100.00%    8.081      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_powerlisting:pcache:idhash:358193-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260802034839 and revision id 2276793. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
